        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alan Thicke\n- TV Shows: Celebrity Cooking Showdown, Growing Pains\n- Roles: host, actor, songwriter, game show host, talk show host, Jason Seaver\n\nFacts:\n- Alan Thicke was born as Alan Willis Jeffrey on March 1, 1947, and he later used the name Alan Willis Thicke.\n- Alan Thicke was a Canadian actor, songwriter, game show host, and talk show host.\n- Alan Thicke hosted Celebrity Cooking Showdown.\n- Alan Thicke was best known for playing Jason Seaver, the father on the ABC television series Growing Pains.\n- Growing Pains ran for seven seasons.\n- Alan Thicke died on December 13, 2016.",
